  "favourites_count": 86,
  "description": "<p>Add verticality to your gameplay. Access previously inaccessible roofs. Hop fences you know you could hop irl.</p>\n<p>This works much better than I ever thought it would. I have never gotten wedged or stuck outside the map anywhere. It works on all objects. Just look up a little and hold space.</p>\n<div class=\"youtube-lite\" data-video-id=\"1WVKBJ5D3W0\" data-embed-url=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/1WVKBJ5D3W0?autoplay=1\"><img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/1WVKBJ5D3W0/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"YouTube video thumbnail\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\n<p>Let me know if you find any good new spots. I have only played Woods.</p>\n",
